{
  "$comment": "Every foreground/background pair the contrast gate (pnpm contrast:check, tools/contrast) evaluates on resolved tokens for every brand in all six colorScheme contexts (ADR-0011, ADR-0020 rule 10, ADR-0022 rule 5). tier: functional = 4.5:1, or 3:1 when minSizePx >= 24 (large text); decorative = 3:1, only with minSizePx >= 24; boundary = 3:1 for UI edges and chart lines that carry meaning. Translucent colors are composited source-over in gamma-encoded sRGB: bg sits on color.bg.page, or on each entry of backdrops in turn (hex colors, and gradient globs whose gradients of the context's base scheme count at every stop, as ADR-0022 §3.3 asks, and at every V1 sample between stops, because a segment can be darker or lighter between two stops than at either), and underlays lists the layers bg may sit on, each checked in turn; a translucent fg is laid over the result. schemes limits a pair to base schemes (their contrast and transparency variants included). stops: all is ADR-0022 V1 (every stop plus 100 samples per segment in gamma sRGB and OKLab); region: card-header is V2 (the Card header block at twelve geometries). No gradient declares a text-safe zone (ADR-0022 §4.1). Every a11y.pairsWith of a sys.color.text.* token must be a pair here (tokens/README.md rule 4). Ratios come from tools/contrast, never from this file.",
  "thresholds": { "functional": 4.5, "functionalLarge": 3.0, "decorative": 3.0, "boundary": 3.0 },
  "pairs": [
    { "fg": "color.text.primary", "bg": "color.bg.page", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.primary", "bg": "color.bg.surface", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.primary", "bg": "color.bg.surface.raised", "tier": "functional", "note": "raised over the page is also the glass fallback (ADR-0022 §1.1)" },
    { "fg": "color.text.secondary", "bg": "color.bg.page", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.secondary", "bg": "color.bg.surface", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.secondary", "bg": "color.bg.surface.raised", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.tertiary", "bg": "color.bg.page", "tier": "functional", "note": "tertiary below 24 px is functional text (ADR-0011): it changes the token, not the threshold" },
    { "fg": "color.text.tertiary", "bg": "color.bg.surface", "tier": "functional" },
    { "fg": "color.text.tertiary", "bg": "color.bg.surface.raised", "tier": "functional" },
