    { "fg": "color.chart.now", "bg": "color.chart.plot", "tier": "boundary", "schemes": ["dark"], "underlays": ["color.bg.page", "color.bg.surface", "color.bg.surface.raised"], "note": "critic G-14, dark only: in light the now marker is accent.500, a redundant mark that always carries its label or value (its token description; visual-dna B3 and A.5), so it never carries meaning alone and ADR-0011's boundary tier does not apply. A light now marker that alone carries meaning uses accent.700 (B3), and this pair then covers both schemes." }
